sequenceDiagram
 actor O as Дежурный
 participant I as Incident
 participant C as Capacity
 participant D as Data
 participant T as Traffic
 participant X as Контроллер
 participant R as Readiness
 O->>I: POST alert, Idempotency-Key
 I-->>O: 202 migrationId
 I->>C: RESERVE
 C-->>I: HELD
 I->>D: PRECHECK
 D-->>I: совместимость подтверждена
 I->>C: PIN
 C-->>I: PINNED
 I->>T: FREEZE commandId=f1
 T->>X: fence A, drain, final checkpoint
 X-->>T: freezeId, checkpoint, epoch=41
 T-->>I: SUCCEEDED через GET operation
 I->>D: VERIFY freezeId + checkpoint
 D-->>I: proofId, checkpoint applied on B
 I->>T: PROMOTE proofId
 T->>C: проверить PINNED
 T->>D: проверить proof
 T->>X: promote B, expectedEpoch=41
 X-->>T: B writer, epoch=42
 I->>T: ROUTE
 T->>X: route B, readback
 X-->>T: route B, healthy
 I->>C: ALLOCATE
 O->>R: завершить задания
 I->>R: CHECK
 R->>T: актуальные writer, fence, route
 R->>D: proof текущего поколения
 R->>C: ALLOCATED
 R-->>I: READY_TO_SHUTDOWN
 I-->>O: подготовка завершена
